OL,3,GNEWSA'Our son was ill and we felt
OL,4,Adismissed as worrying new parents'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Becca and Harvey first raised
OL,7,Fconcerns over their newborn son's rash,
OL,8,Fthey said they felt dismissed by
OL,9,Fhealthcare workers as "worrying new
OL,10,Fparents".
OL,12,FTheir son Roman, who was born in July,
OL,13,Fhad become increasingly unwell during
OL,14,Fhis first few weeks of life, with the
OL,15,Fcouple describing him as swelling,
OL,16,F"screaming for hours" and "clawing at
OL,17,Fhis own face".
