OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Our son was ill and we felt
OL,4,Adismissed as worrying new parents'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecca and Harvey, from Ipswich, said
OL,7,Fthey repeatedly sought medical advice
OL,8,Fand were reassured by medics that his
OL,9,Fsymptoms were normal or attributed to
OL,10,Fconditions such as baby acne.
OL,12,FIn September, two months after his
OL,13,Fsymptoms first appeared, Roman was
OL,14,Fdiagnosed with a cow's milk protein
OL,15,Fallergy (CMPA).
